title: Hermann Müller
is-pinned-card: true 
tags: advisor, centrist
card-image: img/portraits/MüllerHermann.jpg
new-page: true
view-if: muller_advisor = 1

= Herman Müller


Müller is a former [? if chancellor = "Müller": and current ?] Chancellor, [? if president = "Müller": the current President and ?] and is a long-time Social Democratic leader.

- @coalition
- @toleration
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Müller can improve our relationships with our coalition partners.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and spd_in_government = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government: The SPD is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if spd_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; z_relation += 5; ddp_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5

We have improved our relations with the Z, [+ ddp_name +], and DVP, and reduced tensions with the coalition.


@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: Müller supports the toleration arrangement with the bourgeois parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_toleration: The SPD is not in toleration. ?]
choose-if: spd_in_government = 0 and spd_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5;

We have reduced dissent among the anti-toleration factions. 

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Müller can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Müller"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Müller can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Müller"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!
- @root: We do not want to take any action for now.

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ reichsexekution_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: reichsexekution
